## Requirements

### MATLAB
- R2022a or later  
- EEGLAB 2023.x  
- Signal Processing Toolbox  
- `clean_rawdata()` plugin  

### Python
```bash
pip install mne mne-connectivity pingouin networkx numpy pandas matplotlib scipy

